[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=25 format=3]

; Vanta Eclipse UI theme — neon arcade shapes, chunky mobile weight.
;
; Type is Nunito (SIL OFL): 900 for display, 800 for anything pressable, 700
; for body. It replaced Cinzel, whose Roman-inscription caps were the single
; biggest source of the old "fantasy serif" read.
;
; Two rules hold the look together:
;   1. NEON comes from saturated fills over near-black plus a coloured
;      shadow_color at a large shadow_size. Godot's StyleBoxFlat shadow is the
;      only bloom available without a full-screen pass, so it does the work.
;   2. CHUNK comes from large corner radii and a thick BOTTOM border in a
;      darker shade of the fill, which reads as a pressable lip. Pressed
;      states shrink that lip so the button physically sinks.
;
; Accent roles: cyan = primary/affirmative, magenta = premium/prestige,
; violet = carried over so the per-world nebula palettes still harmonise,
; red = danger only.

